  "closure": "Every existing feature regular file before this manifest and the completed handoff is listed exactly once. Those two enclosing metadata files are excluded to avoid self-reference; the handoff binds this manifest.",
  "integration": "Only rows marked final_canonical_source overlay canonical repository paths. All other rows preserve historical/evidence bytes. Maintained-text historical leaves require a .raw evidence suffix if transported into the repository; Root reviews the destination map.",
  "evidence": "execution-evidence-map-r1.json.gz is the original-path/member map for the existing archive, including original receipts/raw/XML/snapshots and nested original-test evidence. The three authored-history maps bind original before-change full-file snapshots. No archive was repacked for this final handoff."
}
